  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centre for HR Sarajevo Un</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MR-center Sarajevos univ.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Administrativt st&#xf6;d till MR-Centret vid Sarajevos universitet genom RWI. Centret arbetar dels med utbildning i MR, dels som ett  forskningscentrum, d&#xe4;r man bl a har ett omfattande bibliotek. Sidas st&#xf6;d &#xe4;r administrativt till centret med en del f&#xf6;r biblioteket.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Structural support to the Human Rights Centre at the University of Sarajevo through RWI. The Centre works with hr education, but also serves as a research centre, with an extensive library on hr issues. Sidas support is mainly for administration but also includes support to the library.</narrative>
  </description>
